            "who": "The Sensei",
            "text": "There is one problem. I cannot watch every portal at once, and I cannot do this alone."
          },
          {
            "who": "Isabella",
            "text": "So who can?"
          },
          {
            "who": "The Sensei",
            "text": "I know just the person. Someone who loves and cares about every student in this school."
          }
